 Television\" every summer. Tezuka Production created anime specials for the event under the supervision of Osamu Tezuka. \"Bremen 4: Jigoku no Naka no Tenshi-tachi\" was produced for the 1981 event. Its title means \"Bremen 4: Angels in Hell\" in English.\n\nThe story is, similar to the Bremen Town Musicians fairy tale by Brothers Grimm, about four animals, Coda the cat, Alegro the dog, Largo the donkey and Minuet the chicken.\n\nThey save Rondo the alien who is on a peace mission. In return Rondo gives them a machine which can transform them into humans. Turned into their new form as humans, they go to the town, where they see the madness of war.\n\n(Source: AniDB)"},"tags":[{"name":"Robots","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Band","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Prison","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Musical Theater","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fairy Tale","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Bremen 4: Jigoku no Naka no Tenshi-tachi","english":null,"native":"ブレーメン４ - 地獄の中の天使たち -","romaji":"Bremen 4: Jigoku no Naka no Tenshi-tachi","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ブレーメン4 地獄の中の天使たち"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"布莱梅4 地狱中的天使"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"不来梅四重奏"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"四神奇"}]},"trailer":{"id":"Kku-l9LI6P4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Kku-l9LI6P4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}